From ccfaa2d7602aaa2c9756ecb9969ef2152887a00e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: User-3090 <71881005+User-3090@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 09:38:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] fix(security): harden curl transfers

Ignore user curl configuration, require TLS 1.2+ HTTPS for initial and redirected runtime transfers, cap redirects, disable URL globbing, and pass each URL as data rather than a possible option.
---
 src/detect/manifest_update.rs | 21 ++++++++---
 src/noninteractive_process.rs | 65 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 src/remote/attach.rs          |  9 ++---
 src/update.rs                 | 27 ++++-----------
 4 files changed, 90 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)

